ext":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"For reproducible installations, pin a commit:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The repository commits its `lib/` artifacts, so a GitHub installation does not need to run a package"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" build script. The bundle adds a unique `ui-song-theme-external` client row; its `theme` service inj"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ection ensures the base dsh theme is ready before this token layer mounts. That row stacks after the"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" Web bundle's built-in theme, and removing the external plugin restores the built-in layer."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Remove it with:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Palette"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Role | Light | Dark |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Base surface | Silk paper | Night ink |\n| Primary text | Warm ink | Pale paper |\n| Accent | Pine b"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"otanical green | Restrained pale jade |\n| Error | Cinnabar | Light cinnabar |\n| Geometry | 2 to 12 p"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"x semantic radii | Same |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Every override has paired light and dark values. Unloading the plugin removes only its layer and res"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tores the theme below it."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Build output is committed intentionally because dsh supports installing plugins directly from Git re"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"t is committed intentionally because dsh supports installing plugins directly from Git repositories."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Node.js `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`\n- DeepSeek Harness UI theme `>=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.2.0`\n- System font a"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"vailability affects exact Song glyph metrics"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
